    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in rolling countryside is this family bungalow. Located close to Dundrum village this property is an ideal home for those who enjoy countryside living. The village is home to multiple nature walks/duck pond/international scout centre etc all located in the popular Dundrum Woods. Dundrum Golf course is a mere 1 mile down the road. All amenities required for day to day living are available in the village which is a bustling area of employment, retail including pharmacy/medical centre/supermarket/DIY/garage etc.The house is well set in in the site with wonderful cut stone entrance and lawns to either side of driveway. The house offers great family space while the grounds are ample to facilitate further development if so desired. A large detached garage offers opportunity for work space/gym etc.An ideal family home and space!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
